crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=92251c62ec8100de1900ef48e98bd801 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello, I hope You are Doing well. \nI would like to commission you please : \nHer is my OC, Hiyoko Ikariname. She is 23 years old. Her favorite flower is lily of the valley. \nI would like an artwork of her that fits the vibe of this music : https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NtJnix-9niI . I'll let you choose how she will pose, but the ideal would be that she'll be holding a lily of the valley and a red carnation. i would love her to have a gentle smile. \n\nHere is some pic of her : https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1y5_VKdkwvd25zs4lqPcxnjCVy2upbxSv?usp=sharing\n\nThank you very much and I hope that you will enjoy drawing her!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Yuzuriko_red/works/90", "scraped_at": "2026-02-14T14:57:26.827357+00:00", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c67c5714/uploads/origins/ea85e841-5e1d-4835-9b70-531ef48908e4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=a635c557dea8572d24e70fb87ae7980c", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c67c5714/uploads/origins/ea85e841-5e1d-4835-9b70-531ef48908e4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=a635c557dea8572d24e70fb87ae7980c, https://si.imgix.net/c67c5714/uploads/origins/ea85e841-5e1d-4835-9b70-531ef48908e4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=a2c841ba1c723565f04bda65cd472200 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c67c5714/uploads/origins/ea85e841-5e1d-4835-9b70-531ef48908e4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsiz